[198.575337, "o", "\u001b[?2026h\u001b7\u001b[2;77H\u001b[38;5;210m\u2584\u001b[38;5;210m\u2580\u001b[38;5;210m\u2588 \u001b[38;5;216m\u2588\u001b[38;5;216m\u2580\u001b[38;5;216m\u2584\u001b[38;5;216m\u2580\u001b[38;5;216m\u2588 \u001b[38;5;216m\u2580\u001b[38;5;222m\u2588\u001b[38;5;222m\u2580\u001b[0m\u001b[3;77H\u001b[38;5;210m\u2588\u001b[38;5;210m\u2580\u001b[38;5;210m\u2588 \u001b[38;5;216m\u2588 \u001b[38;5;216m\u2580 \u001b[38;5;216m\u2588 \u001b[38;5;222m\u2584\u001b[38;5;222m\u2588\u001b[38;5;222m\u2584\u001b[0m\u001b[4;77H\u001b]8;;https://www.superinference.org\u0007\u001b[2mwww.superinference.org\u001b[22m\u001b]8;;\u0007\u001b[0m\u001b8\u001b[29A\u001b[1G\u001b[K\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u001b[1mDiff between the two commits (git diff HEAD~1 HEAD)\u001b[22m\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[Kdiff --git a/hello.py b/hello.py\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[Kindex 1385fe3..34c0a55 100644\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K--- a/hello.py\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K+++ b/hello.py\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K@@ -1 +1,2 @@\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K-print(\"Hello, world!\")\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\\ No newline at end of file\r\r\n\u001b[2G\u001b[Kprint(\"Hello, world!\")\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K+print(\"Goodbye, world!\")\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\\ No newline at end of file\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[KThe only change between commits is the added print(\"Goodbye, world!\") line in hello.py. README.md\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[Kwas untouched by the second commit, so it doesn't appear in the diff.\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[KOne thing worth noting: the auto-formatter stripped the trailing newline from hello.py, which is why\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[Kgit shows the \\ No newline at end of file markers on both the removed and added lines \u2014 git is just\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[Kflagging that neither version ends in a newline.\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u2605\r\r\n\u001b[3G\u001b[K\u001b[38;5;239m\u001b[2m\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u250